Third-Party Acknowledgments

Orbit and Launch Alert is an independent, open-source MeshMonitor Auto Responder script designed to integrate with:

- MeshMonitor (by Yeraze)
- Meshtastic (open-source LoRa mesh networking platform)
- MeshCore (open-source LoRa mesh networking platform)
- The Space Devs Launch Library 2 API (https://thespacedevs.com/llapi)
- CelesTrak GP orbital data (https://celestrak.org/)
- python-sgp4 by Brandon Rhodes (MIT License, https://github.com/brandon-rhodes/python-sgp4), installed separately as a dependency

This project uses official public launch schedules and orbital element data. It does not scrape websites, rebroadcast proprietary feeds, or distribute shared API credentials.

All trademarks, logos, and brand names are the property of their respective owners.
Orbit and Launch Alert is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or officially connected to MeshMonitor, Meshtastic, MeshCore, The Space Devs, CelesTrak, NASA, SpaceX, or any other referenced platform, provider, agency, or organization.
